# runes

> *எழுத்து என்பது ஒரு வாளை விட கூர்மையானது*
> "The written word is sharper than a sword."

Personal dotfiles and system configuration — Fedora 43 KDE · Sway · Wayland.

---

## Structure

```
runes/
├── dotfiles/
│   └── nvim/                   # Neovim — Lazy.nvim, LSP, Treesitter, Telescope
│       ├── init.lua
│       ├── lazy-lock.json
│       └── lua/
│           ├── config/         # keybinds, lazy, options
│           └── plugins/        # autopairs, cmp, colors, explorer,
│                               # lsp, telescope, treesitter
├── kde/
│   └── konsole/                # Konsole terminal — Monokai colorscheme
│       ├── Monokai.colorscheme
│       └── Monokai_JetBrain.profile
└── sway/                       # Sway WM + Waybar
    ├── sway_config.txt
    ├── waybar_config.txt
    ├── style.css
    └── net-speed.txt
```

