---

## Neovim Plugins

| Plugin | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| Lazy.nvim | Plugin manager |
| nvim-lspconfig | LSP client |
| nvim-treesitter | Syntax & parsing |
| telescope.nvim | Fuzzy finder |
| nvim-cmp | Completion engine |
| nvim-autopairs | Auto bracket pairs |
| nvim-tree | File explorer |

---

## Setup

Clone into your home:

```bash
git clone git@github.com:PrasDurai-43-Personal/runes.git ~/<Your-Directory>
```

Symlink what you need:

```bash
# Neovim
ln -sf ~/<Your-Directory>/runes/dotfiles/nvim ~/.config/nvim

# Sway
ln -sf ~/<Your-Directory>/runes/sway/sway_config.txt ~/.config/sway/config

# Waybar
ln -sf ~/<Your-Directory>/runes/sway/waybar_config.txt ~/.config/waybar/config
ln -sf ~/<Your-Directory>/runes/sway/style.css ~/.config/waybar/style.css

# Starship
ln -sf ~/<Your-Directory>/runes/dotfiles/starship/starship.toml ~/.config/starship.toml
```

